        "- This set opens and closes with the same song: the Roy Ayers original at track 1 and Netsky's liquid drum & bass version at track 26. Check which Netsky edit you have - it circulates in a few different lengths."
      ],
      [
        "- Several classics run very long in album form. Where a shorter edit exists the note says so - 'Street Life' (11:16 album), 'Just the Two of Us' (7:21), 'Sun Goddess' (8:30) and 'Could Heaven Ever Be Like This' (9:14). The listed times assume the edits."
      ],
      [
        "- Deliberately no peak. It drifts from 84 to about 120 BPM across two hours and the last three tracks tilt towards dancing so the handover to the disco set is not abrupt."
